BEGIN PROGRAM

    DISPLAY "Enter text to append to the file:"
    GET userInput

    OPEN "CSC450_CT5_mod5.txt" in APPEND mode
    WRITE userInput to the file
    CLOSE the file

    OPEN "CSC450_CT5_mod5.txt" in READ mode
    READ entire file contents into a string variable called fileData
    CLOSE the file

    CALL reverseString(fileData) and store result in reversedData

    OPEN "CSC450-mod5-reverse.txt" in WRITE mode
    WRITE reversedData to the file
    CLOSE the file

END PROGRAM
